# The commit of qoryai/qory the end to end job builds the node's command from: a commit of
# qory's next branch, until it reaches qory's main, built against Forager at the ref in
# .forager-e2e-ref. It signs every
# request with the node's Ed25519 access key, verifies every answer under the pin, and
# keeps each run's record in its state directory on the node, outside the checkout.
